<div class="mb-12" data-reveal>
  <h2 class="mb-5 text-[26px] font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-tight text-[#111827] md:text-[30px]">Speed decides the lead</h2>
  <p class="mb-5 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280] md:text-[17px]">
    Property enquirers often contact several agents at once, and the first useful reply tends to keep the conversation. Most agencies cannot reply instantly at night, at weekends or during viewings.
  </p>
  <p class="text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280] md:text-[17px]">
    An automated first response that acknowledges the enquiry, answers common questions and offers a viewing time closes that gap without extra headcount.
  </p>
</div>

<div class="mb-12" data-reveal>
  <h2 class="mb-5 text-[26px] font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-tight text-[#111827] md:text-[30px]">Qualifying without friction</h2>
  <p class="mb-5 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280] md:text-[17px]">
    An assistant can ask the questions an agent would ask: budget range, timeline, location, household needs and whether a sale is involved. Capturing this in a structured record means the agent starts the call informed.
  </p>
  <p class="text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280] md:text-[17px]">
    Keep questions few and conversational. A long form loses more leads than it qualifies.
  </p>
</div>

<div class="mb-12" data-reveal>
  <h2 class="mb-5 text-[26px] font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-tight text-[#111827] md:text-[30px]">Supporting a relocation</h2>
  <p class="mb-5 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280] md:text-[17px]">
    Moving house, especially downsizing later in life, is a long decision with many questions about timing, selling, logistics and settling in. Clear, patient and consistent answers matter more here than speed.
  </p>
  <p class="text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280] md:text-[17px]">
    This is the setting in which Zunkiree infrastructure supports Chayce Properties, covered in its case study.
  </p>
</div>

<div class="mb-12" data-reveal>
  <h2 class="mb-5 text-[26px] font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-tight text-[#111827] md:text-[30px]">Handoff and measurement</h2>
  <p class="mb-5 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280] md:text-[17px]">
    Pass the full conversation and the captured details to a named agent, with a clear time commitment. Measure response time, share of enquiries that reach a viewing and share that convert.
  </p>
  <p class="text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280] md:text-[17px]">
    Review a sample of conversations monthly to refine the answers and fix gaps.
  </p>
</div>

